      "latin": "Kallā layumbażanna fil-ḥuṭamah(ti).",
      "translation_id": "Sekali-kali tidak! Pasti dia akan dilemparkan ke dalam (neraka) Hutamah.",
      "translation_en": "No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher.",
